--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files in this package derived from the upstream sources, and modified
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/server/injected/injected_script_source.dart
    Hand port of the in-page selector engine: packages/injected/src/
    domUtils.ts, selectorUtils.ts, roleUtils.ts, roleSelectorEngine.ts, the
    `internal:*` engines of injectedScript.ts, and packages/isomorphic/
    stringUtils.ts#normalizeWhiteSpace. The ARIA role and attribute tables
    are reproduced closely. Modified: the selector parser and the CSS
    tokenizer are not ported (selectors arrive as structured JSON), the
    accessible-name computation returns plain text, and element stability is
    sampled between polls rather than between animation frames.

lib/src/server/us_keyboard_layout.dart
    Port of packages/playwright-core/src/server/usKeyboardLayout.ts.
    Modified: re-expressed as Dart records and expanded at load time.

lib/src/server/mac_editing_commands.dart
    Port of packages/playwright-core/src/server/macEditingCommands.ts.
    Modified: re-expressed as a Dart map.

lib/src/server/chromium/chromium_switches.dart
    Port of packages/playwright-core/src/server/chromium/
    chromiumSwitches.ts. Modified: reduced to the switches this port uses.

lib/src/registry/browsers_json.dart
    The browser revision table from packages/playwright-core/browsers.json,
    embedded as a Dart string. Modified: trimmed to the browsers this port
    downloads.

lib/src/registry/registry.dart
    Executable and download path mappings, and the CDN mirror list, from
    packages/playwright-core/src/server/registry/index.ts.

lib/src/server/selectors.dart
    Selector-building behaviour mirrored from packages/isomorphic/
    stringUtils.ts and packages/playwright-core/src/utils/isomorphic/
    locatorUtils.ts.

lib/src/server/core_page.dart, lib/src/server/core_browser.dart,
lib/src/server/core_events.dart, lib/src/server/mouse.dart,
lib/src/server/keyboard.dart, lib/src/server/frames.dart,
lib/src/server/chromium/*.dart, lib/src/server/firefox/*.dart,
lib/src/server/webkit/*.dart
    Independent Dart implementations whose protocol sequences and semantics
    follow named upstream sources. Each such alignment is cited in the
    comments of the file it appears in.
